{
 "priority": 2,
 "source_bins": [
  "sound_auth.bin",
  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "This is Kume, just before he died.": "",
  "This is Kume before his death.": "",
  "Before the killer took his eyes.": "",
  "C'mon, don't say stuff like that.": "",
  "So what's the prosecution's angle on this?": "",
  "And the prosecution has some angle on this?\nWhat's the story they're selling?": "",
  "Well, try thinkin' about it in the\ncontext of the Tojo-Kyorei feud.": "",
  "Well, think about it from their perspective.\nThe Tojo-Kyorei feud is framing this whole thing.": "",
  "Two other Kyorei yakuza turned up dead\nbefore this, each with their eyes gouged out.": "",
  "Two other Kyorei yakuza turned up dead before this,\neach with their eyes gouged out.": "",
  "Not a far leap to assume the Tojo's\nresponsible for all three murders.": "",
  "So between all these dead foreign yakuza, they're thinking\nthe Tojo's got motive enough to cover all three murders.": "",
  "You follow?": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(There's a good chance the murders are the result\nof a Tojo Clan versus Kyorei Clan turf war.)</color>": "",
  "Yup, go on.": "",
  "All right. This is how the prosecution\nthinks it all went down.": "",
  "All right. With that in mind, this is how\nthe prosecution thinks it all went down.": "",
  "So they've got three things: the camera footage,\nthe bloodstains in the club, and Hamura's swiss cheese alibi.": "",
  "They have Amour's camera footage, the bloodstains\nin the club, and Hamura's swiss cheese alibi.": "",
  "Any of those alone wouldn't be\nenough to get a conviction.": "",
  "But with all three, the prosecution\nthinks they've got this case in the bag.": "",
  "End of the day, to them,\nit's just yakuza offing yakuza.": "",
  "To them it's just yakuza offing yakuza.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Guess there's a lot of reasons\nfor them to suspect Hamura.)</color>": "",
  "Makes sense they'd see it that way.": "",
  "I'm more interested in what you think, though.": "",
  "But... I want to know what <font_kind=yakuza_italic>you</font_kind> think.": "",
  "Did Hamura actually kill Kume?": "",
  "Do you believe Hamura actually killed Kume?\nShintani-sensei?": "",
  "I dunno. The guy rubs me the wrong way, yeah...\nBut I'm pretty sure he's innocent.": "",
  "Hamura rubs me the wrong way, yeah...\nBut I dunno. I think he's innocent.": "",
  "A cunning yakuza like Hamura wouldn't just offload\nthe corpse in an alley like that. Too sloppy.": "",
  "Hamura's a smart, veteran gangster. He wouldn't\njust offload the corpse in an alley like that. Too sloppy.": "",
  "If he really did it... forget about the eyes.\nYou'd never even find the body.": "",
  "Forget about the eyes.\nYou'd never even find the body.": "",
  "Agreed.": "",
  "That's our Shintani-sensei. Prickliest guy in town,\nbut damn if he's not a terrific lawyer.": "",
  "With you there.": "",
  "Was that supposed to be a compliment?": "",
  "What? Something wrong?": "",
  "If Hamura didn't do it, the person who did\nis still out there somewhere.": "",
  "We've just gotta find them if we\nwant to clear Hamura's name.": "",
  "Hah. You think we've got\nthe manpower for that?": "",
  "Hah. Just like that?\nWe don't have the manpower.": "",
  "Tracking down a criminal like that takes an entire organized front.\nBest leaving that to the cops if you ask me.": "",
  "Tracking down a criminal? That takes an entire organized front.\nIf I were you, I'd leave that to the cops.": "",
  "My only job here is defending Hamura.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(A lawyer's job is only to prove\nreasonable doubt, not the defendant's innocence...)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(To them, the truth... is irrelevant.)</color>": "",
  "Then what's your next move?": "",
  "Gonna need some more info\non the victim.": "",
  "Remember Kume's buddy? The one who ran off\nwhen the Matsugane boys jumped them.": "",
  "Remember Kume's buddy?\nThe one who ran off during the attack?": "",
  "Name's Akira Murase, from the Kyorei Clan.\nI want to hear what he has to say.": "",
  "Another Kyorei thug. Akira Murase.\nI want to hear what he has to say.": "",
  "About what he did after he watched\nKume get dragged into the club.": "",
  "After Kume got dragged into the club,\nwhat did Murase do next?": "",
  "Did he really just abandon his friend?\nHard to believe.": "",
  "A yakuza doesn't just abandon his brothers.\nThere's gotta be more to the story.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(He's right. No self-respecting yakuza\nwould run off and leave his buddy to die.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Murase must have at least attempted a rescue,\nbut to find out for sure, that would mean...)</color>": "",
  "C'mon, man. Is this the time to go knocking on the\nKyorei Clan's door? Sounds like suicide to me.": "",
  "C'mon, man. You want us to go knockin' on the\nKyorei's door? Some of their boys just got murdered.": "",
  "I bet they're out for blood\nafter what happened to Kume.": "",
  "They're probably out for blood, yeah.": "",
  "One way or another,\nI want that info from Murase.": "",
  "I want to hear it from Murase.": "",
  "You're the ones who have to figure out how\nto get it. That's the deal, remember?": "",
  "As for how to get it, that's up to you.\nThat's the deal, remember?": "",
  "The deal, my ass. Pokin' a hornet's nest ain't\ngonna get us anything but stung.": "",
  "Deal, my ass.\nPokin' this bee's nest ain't gonna—": "",
  "He's right though.": "",
  "Point taken.": "",
  "Come on, Kaito-san.": "",
  "Okay. Come on, Kaito-san.": "",
  "First things first, we need to find out where the Kyorei Clan's\nhiding. They've gotta have a base or something.": "",
  "First, we gotta find out where the Kyorei Clan's hiding\nin Kamurocho. They've gotta have a base or something.": "",
  "Probably quickest to just go ask Matsugane-san.\nHe's got all the real Tojo Clan dirt.": "",
  "Probably quickest to just go ask Matsugane-san.\nHe has all the Tojo intel a guy could want.": "",
  "Oh, uh... I guess I'll pass.\nCan't exactly waltz in, bein' expelled and all.": "",
  "Yeah I'll take care of this one by myself.\nI'll call you when I'm done.": "",
  "Makes sense. I figured I'd head over alone.\nI'll call you when I'm done.": "",
  "Go talk to that Kyorei guy, Murase.": "",
  "I wanna know what he did\nafter Kume got nabbed.": "",
  "You should go see Matsugane-san alone.\nSorry I'm kinda useless here.": "",
  "Kaito-san. Just left the Matsugane Office.": "",
  "The Kyorei are shacked up\nin some place called KJ Art.": "",
  "Sounds like the Kyorei are shacked up\nin some place called KJ Art.": "",
  "Huh. And that's where we'll find Murase?": "",
  "Not sure. We won't know if we\ndon't check it out ourselves.": "",
  "Well, we won't know until we\ncheck it out ourselves.  ": "",
  "You're thinking stakeout, huh?": "",
  "Sounds like the perfect time\nto give the drone a whirl!": "",
  "Hey... Sounds like the perfect job\nfor the drone!": "",
  "That might be our only choice.": "",
  "Mm, that might be our only choice.": "",
  "Fingers crossed.\nAnyway, I'll see you over there.": "",
  "Fingers crossed.\nAnyway, I'll see you at KJ Art.": "",
  "It's me. You at KJ art yet?": "",
  "It's Kaito. You at KJ Art yet?": "",
  "Looks like it.\nWhere are you?": "",
  "Yeah, looks like it.\nKaito, where are you?": "",
  "I'm on the opposite roof.\nLook up.": "",
  "Face KJ Art and look right.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(There he is!\nThat shirt's like a homing beacon.)</color>": "",
  "I see you.\nBe up in a sec.": "",
  "I see you. Be up in a sec.": "",
  "Face KJ Art and look right.\nI'm up on the roof.": "",
  "Face KJ, look to the right,\nand he should be on the roof...": "",
  "What are you doing?\nQuit farting around and get over here.": "",
  "Hey, Tak, what are you doing?\nGet over here.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Well, that's <font_kind=yakuza_italic>definitely</font_kind> not Kaito.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(How'd those two even get up there?)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(That's... just some woman smoking.\nGotta look for Kaito.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(A calico. Pretty cute. is it true all calicos are\nfemale? Er... I should probably find Kaito.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(That's... an employee at the cat café.\nGotta look for Kaito.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(That's... Wait, is he giving her a shoulder massage?\nShe doesn't look too into it.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Right now I need to look for Kaito.)</color>": "",
  "Yo. Helluva view, wouldn't you say?": "",
  "Yo. Great view of KJ Art, huh?": "",
  "Too bad the place is absolutely\ncrawling with yakuza.": "",
  "Take a look at that. Place is absolutely\ncrawling with yakuza.": "",
  "Guess this is the Kyorei hideout after all.": "",
  "Guess this is a Kyorei hideout after all.": "",
  "No doubt.": "",
  "And Murase?": "",
  "And Murase? Is he here?": "",
  "Couldn't find him.\nI looked pretty damn hard with the drone, too.": "",
  "Couldn't find him. I looked pretty damn hard\nwith the drone, too.": "",
  "You sure it was hard enough?": "",
  "Huh. Did you look hard enough?": "",
  "Uh... Sure?": "",
  "Uh... Yeah, Sure.": "",
  "Come on, let's try again.\nI'll fly it this time.": "",
  "When you want something done,\ndo it yourself, right?": "",
  "Gotta show you how it's done.": "",
  "Sure, ya ass.": "",
  "Go right ahead.": "",
  "(I need to pick \"Flight\" to fly the drone.)": "",
  "This here is Murase.": "",
  "Wonder if we can just peek through\nthe windows, see if we can find him.": "",
  "If we want to find Murase in the building,\nwe'd better check all the windows.": "",
  "You forget we're looking for Murase or something?\nFly that thing back over to KJ Art.": "",
  "Hey, the hell are you doing? Fly that thing\nback over to KJ Art. We gotta find Murase, and fast.": "",
  "What's with the book?\nDon't these guys have anything better to do?": "",
  "Hold up, hold up! That's him!": "",
  "Hey! That's Murase, right!?": "",
  "Shit, he went inside.\nLet's try and figure out where to.": "",
  "Shit. We gotta figure out\nwhere he went.": "",
  "Hey, there he is!\nWell fuckin' done man!": "",
  "Hey, there he is! That's Murase, all right!\nNice going, Tak! Well fucking done!": "",
  "(This must be the entrance.\nDoesn't look like Murase's here.)": "",
  "(Just a bunch of desks in here. Is this where\nthe low level grunts do their work?)": "",
  "(I don't see Murase.\nShould check somewhere else.)": "",
  "(Dammit. The blinds are down and I can't see in.\nGonna have to just look somewhere else.)": "",
  "(Whoa, this is a fancy room.\nDon't see Murase, though.)": "",
  "Guy has his own office, huh?\nHe must be important.": "",
  "Guy has his own office, huh? Man. If he's got a place\nall to himself, he must be important.": "",
  "Think they'd let us meet him?": "",
  "We wouldn't get past the front door.": "",
  "Heh, especially if we told\n'em why we're here.": "",
  "Heh, especially if we told 'em we're defending Hamura.\nThey'd hunt us down.": "",
  "We'll need to find another way in if we\nwant to put the squeeze on Murase.": "",
  "If we want to put the squeeze on Murase,\nwe'll need to find another way in.": "",
  "Agreed. What're you thinking?": "",
  "Well, there's a few options on the table.": "",
  "As for the best one...": "",
  "I could try scaling the side of the building,\nthen climbing in through an open window.": "",
  "I could try scaling the side of the building,\nthen climb in through an open window.": "",
  "Do you even know how to scale a building?\nBesides, people'd see you doing it.": "",
  "You even know <font_kind=yakuza_italic>how</font_kind> to scale a building?\nBesides, if you tried that, people'd see you doing it.": "",
  "Not to mention the bloodbath\nif someone spotted you...": "",
  "And if you climb through into a horde of thugs,\nyou'd never make it out.": "",
  "...Guess so, yeah.": "",
  "Let's kill that idea, then.\nYou got a plan B?": "",
  "That can't be all you got, right?\nYou got a plan B or something?": "",
  "Maybe I could go undercover.": "",
  "Oh yeah? Who as?": "",
  "I was thinking pizza delivery.": "",
  "...You ever seen a pizza guy\nget invited inside?": "",
  "Right, forget the pizza.\nWhat about some kind of repairman?": "",
  "Okay, let's lose the pizza.\nWhat about a maintenance guy?": "",
  "Now you're talking my language.\nThey've got jumpsuits over at Don Quijote.": "",
  "Whoa... Now you're talking my language.\nThey've got jumpsuits over at Don Quijote.": "",
  "Still, you can't show up and expect 'em\nto just let you stroll on in there.": "",
  "Still, you won't be able to stroll on in.\nYou'll need a plan.": "",
  "True, huh...": "",
  "What a shame.": "",
  "I think I've got it.": "",
  "Maybe that's our ticket in though?": "",
  "What would they do\nif the heater broke?": "",
  "Call a repairman, obviously.\nAre you suggesting we just wait 'til it breaks?": "",
  "Call a repairman, obviously.\nSo what, we wait 'til it breaks?": "",
  "I dunno, maybe we could speed things up a bit.": "",
  "Maybe we could speed things up a bit.": "",
  "Never thought I'd see the day\nyou came up with a plan like that.": "",
  "Aha... I get ya.": "",
  "Who are you and where'd\nyou bury Tak's body?": "",
  "Listen to you, all devious and shit!\nWhat did you do with the real Tak?": "",
  "If I told you I'd have to kill you.": "",
  "Don't know what you're\ntalking about.": "",
  "Anyway, I'm gonna make things a little chilly\nfor these KJ guys. You keep watch, okay?": "",
  "Now, I'm gonna make things a little chilly\nfor these guys. Kaito-san, you keep watch, okay?": "",
  "Sounds good.\nLet's do this shit!": "",
  "Yeah. Come on, let's do this shit!": "",
  "I'll force my way in.\nJust kick down the door and go.": "",
  "Dude, they're the yakuza, not you.\nHow bout you put a little more thought into this?": "",
  "Dude, that should be our last resort, not our Plan A.\nWe've got time, so let's use it, huh?": "",
  "I thought you liked things quick and dirty.": "",
  "Kaito-san, I thought you liked things\nquick and dirty.": "",
  "Pretty sure that's you, Tak.\nAnyway, you have any other ideas?": "",
  "Pretty sure that's just you.\nAnyway, got any other ideas?": "",
  "(Damn, it's locked.\nGuess I'll just have to pick it.)": "",
  "(Huh? Who's texting me?)": "",
  "(Dammit. Gotta hurry.)": "",
  "Hey, what are you doing?\nCan I have a few words?": "",
  "Hey, what are you doing?\nLet me talk to you for a bit.": "",
  "(Ugh... Dammit.)": "",
  "(All right, just have to...)": "",
  "(There. No way are they fixing that\nwithout a pro.)": "",
  "(Now for my disguise.\nDon Quijote, here I come.)": "",
  "Checkin' in.\nYou get the goods?": "",
  "Tak! You get the goods?": "",
  "Yeah. I'm heading back now.": "",
  "Better hurry, the plan's working.": "",
  "Good. Better hurry it up.": "",
  "KJ Art's chilling out over here.\nThey just called a repairman.": "",
  "KJ Art's chilling out over here. They just noticed their\nheating's down. A repairman's on the way.": "",
  "Perfect. I'll be there as soon as I can.": "",
  "Perfect. So am I.": "",
  "I'm ready.": "",
  "Okay, ready.": "",
  "Get changed then, would ya?": "",
  "Well then, better get changed.": "",
  "Okay, okay!": "",
  "(Now to get into that jumpsuit.)": "",
  "Nice, I think this'll work.": "",
  "Okay, all suited up.": "",
  "I know you're in a disguise and all, but don't let\nyour guard down, okay? Try to blend in.": "",
  "Hey, don't let your guard down in there, okay?\nYou still gotta try to blend in.": "",
  "Who do you think you're talking to?": "",
  "Hey, I've got this. See you.": "",
  "(Not now. I need to head to KJ Art.)": "",
  "(I'm heading into a yakuza hotbed.\nNeed to make sure I don't break character.)": "",
  "(First things first.\nGotta get past reception.)": "",
  "Excuse me, Sir.\nDo you have an appointment?": "",
  "(Guess the uniform alone isn't good enough.\nI'll need to convince her I'm the real deal.)": "",
  "(It'll be suspicious if I leave without doing my job.\nBesides, I'm here for Murase.)": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(It's dark... I need to turn on the lights before\nI can look for the blueprints for the building.)<color=ｍonologue>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(All right, time to look for the blueprints.)</color>": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "Agreed.": "เห็นด้วย",
  "With you there.": "เอาด้วยเลย",
  "Point taken.": "เข้าใจแล้วค่ะ",
  "No doubt.": "ไม่ต้องสงสัยเลย",
  "Go right ahead.": "เชิญเลย",
  "What a shame.": "น่าเสียดายจริงๆ",
  "I'm ready.": "พร้อมแล้ว"
 }
}
